    "created_at": "2022-02-08T14:50:06Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-02-08T14:54:26Z",
    "body": "Okay, so then this is the proposal on the table:\r\n\r\n1. Add the [EnforceRange] attribute to the numeric arguments of createImageBitmap.\r\n2. createImageBitmap rejects the returned promise with a QuotaExceededError Exception if the underlying bitmap could not be allocated for any reason (out of memory, internal arithmetic overflow)\r\n\r\nNote: the resizeWidth and resizeHeight arguments of ImageBitmapOptions already have the [EnforceRange] attribute.",
