    "updated_at": "2022-02-08T15:30:17Z",
    "body": "I personally like that proposal, but I don't insist on it. In particular it seemed like you were suggesting a more silent-failure approach like Gecko, and if you think that'd be better for web developers I'm happy to take your advice (based on domain expertise) over mine (based on consistency/theoretical purity).",
